name: Reject an unsupported generated node role without repair, acceptance or lost spending
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_node_roles.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/context-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 planned | one-approved-job
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | one-job-started
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_node_roles.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 1 failed | rejected-role
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | retained-rejection
expect: rejected-context-output.txt
expect: d output
expect: no model repair request
ask: Does a successful model reply with an unsupported DFD role clearly fail context acceptance, retain the spent request and offer explicit local inspection without automatic repair?
keys: d
require-live-snap: 25 REJECTED CONTEXT OUTPUT | local-diagnostic
expect: UNACCEPTED MODEL OUTPUT
keys: Enter m n s t Tab
require-live-snap: 15 REJECTED CONTEXT OUTPUT | diagnostic-owns-input
expect-not: REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE
resize: 160x48
live-snap: diagnostic-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: diagnostic-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: diagnostic-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: diagnostic-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: diagnostic-40x12
expect: d / Esc back · PgUp/Dn read
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 This output is unaccepted. | diagnostic-tail
ask: Is the complete bounded rejected response readable at all six sizes, with acceptance blocked and the original context and source intact?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | failure-restored
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 15 CAMPAIGN invalid-node-role | job-history
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/context-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 failed | same-failed-job
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 d output | same-rejection
keys: d
require-live-snap: 25 REJECTED CONTEXT OUTPUT | no-color-rejection
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/generated_node_roles.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does restart retain the same failed attempt, bounded diagnostic, one consumed request and original active context without creating another job or request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
